  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      350.77,
      539.88,
      373.84
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 3 and 4 of the Societies Ordinance (Chapter 123), I, Rishad BathiudeenMinister of Industry and Commerce, do by this notification.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      85.65,
      386.77,
      539.92,
      421.84
    ],
    "text": "01.Authorize the purpose for which the Society known as \u201cSri Lanka Videsha Bauddha Wandana GamanSanvidayakayange Sangamaya\u201d situated at Nalandaramaya, Nalandarama Road, Nugegoda as a purpose towhich the powers and facilities of that Ordinance ought to be extended ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      85.65,
      434.77,
      539.91,
      457.84
    ],
    "text": "02.Limit the application of that Ordinance to aforesaid society by exempting it from the provision of Section5(4) of that Ordinance.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
